  "name": "Make STM9 Great Again!",
  "slug": "make-stm9-great-again",
  "teaser": "The STM-9 is a great weapon, but it has some flaws. This mod aims to fix them",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1639.png",
  "downloads": 3636,
  "favourites_count": 6,
  "description": "<blockquote>\n<h1>Mods on Hiatus / Support Paused</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Status:</strong> No updates planned due to focus on other projects.</li>\n<li><strong>Open Invitation:</strong> The community has full permission to update, modify, and redistribute these mods. Feel free to fork the repository and build your own version.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Changes</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Add full auto fire mode (800 rpm)</li>\n<li>Increases ergonomics</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"install mod\" /></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <code>Make-STM-great-again.zip</code>.</li>\n<li>Drag and drop the files directly into the root folder of your SPT installation..</li>\n<li>The folders should merge automatically. If you get a prompt to overwrite files, say yes.</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>The sound of the full auto fire mode is a bit weird.</li>\n<li>Fire mode toggle lacks a visual animation.</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/Q5Q116JYQN\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"ko-fi\" /></a></p>\n",
